    {
      "id": "business-paragraph",
      "text": "On Tuesday, I helped deploy the cache to two servers. In our 30-minute test, median latency for repeated requests fell from 80 ms to 60 ms. We have not tested cold starts or the other eight servers. The cache could reduce support tickets. The dashboard still shows yesterday's data.",
      "note": ""
